# Pipeline-generated artifacts (do not commit)
runs/*
# ...but track the runtime-essential files of PROMOTED strategies so the live
# trader can load them after a plain `git pull` (no manual scp). Heavy
# artifacts/ (parquet/csv) and __pycache__ stay out. Per-strategy block:
#   git rule needs each parent dir re-included before a nested file can be.
# --- eth_s5_half_size ---
!runs/eth_s5_half_size_oos/
runs/eth_s5_half_size_oos/*
!runs/eth_s5_half_size_oos/config.json
!runs/eth_s5_half_size_oos/code/
runs/eth_s5_half_size_oos/code/*
!runs/eth_s5_half_size_oos/code/signal_engine.py

research/manifests/candidates_*.json
# ...except the curated candidate selections — these are the deployable
# factor-selection seed. Without them stage1 falls back to LEGACY factors and a
# live strategy's required factors (e.g. eth_s5 funding_z/stablecoin_supply_z)
# are never produced. Track them so VPS deploys run DYNAMIC selection.
!research/manifests/candidates_btc.json
!research/manifests/candidates_eth.json
!research/manifests/candidates_sol.json
research/manifests/factor_*.json
research/manifests/factor_*.md
research/manifests/regime_*.json
research/manifests/selection*.json
research/manifests/*/generation.json
research/manifests/*/diagnosis.json
research/manifests/*/optimization.json
research/manifests/*/manifest.json
# ...but track promoted strategies' manifest.json (dashboard list + promote).
!research/manifests/eth_s5_half_size/manifest.json
research/strategies/strategy_btc_*.yaml
research/strategies/strategy_eth_*.yaml
research/strategies/strategy_sol_*.yaml
research/strategies/strategy_*-USDT-*.yaml
research/strategies/code/*/signal_engine.py
research/strategies/code/*/test_signal_engine.py
# ...but TRACK curated (hand-authored, registered in strategy_runs.json) strategies'
# yaml + compiled signal_engine, so the deploy server can backtest/promote them.
# Auto-generated archetype strategies (single_factor/trend_with_gate/consensus_all)
# stay ignored — they are reproducible by re-running the pipeline.
!research/strategies/strategy_btc_s7_stablecoin_funding_gated.yaml
!research/strategies/strategy_btc_s8_funding_z_contrarian.yaml
!research/strategies/strategy_btc_s9_stablecoin_funding_gated_tuned.yaml
!research/strategies/strategy_eth_s1_multi_factor_consensus.yaml
!research/strategies/strategy_eth_s5_half_size.yaml
!research/strategies/strategy_eth_s3_dynamic_exit.yaml
!research/strategies/strategy_sol_s1_multi_factor_consensus.yaml
!research/strategies/strategy_sol_s2_stablecoin_trend_gated.yaml
!research/strategies/code/btc_s7_stablecoin_funding_gated/signal_engine.py
!research/strategies/code/btc_s8_funding_z_contrarian/signal_engine.py
!research/strategies/code/btc_s9_stablecoin_funding_gated_tuned/signal_engine.py
!research/strategies/code/eth_s1_multi_factor_consensus/signal_engine.py
!research/strategies/code/eth_s5_half_size/signal_engine.py
!research/strategies/code/eth_s3_dynamic_exit/signal_engine.py
!research/strategies/code/sol_s1_multi_factor_consensus/signal_engine.py
!research/strategies/code/sol_s2_stablecoin_trend_gated/signal_engine.py
!research/strategies/code/sol_s1_single_factor_regime/signal_engine.py
